,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://radiofreebucktown.substack.com/i/185629036?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F955fb545-620d-4bde-85a7-408a4d90e81d_1170x781.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7B5P!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F955fb545-620d-4bde-85a7-408a4d90e81d_1170x781.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7B5P!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F955fb545-620d-4bde-85a7-408a4d90e81d_1170x781.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7B5P!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F955fb545-620d-4bde-85a7-408a4d90e81d_1170x781.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7B5P!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F955fb545-620d-4bde-85a7-408a4d90e81d_1170x781.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg role="img" style="height:20px;width:20px" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><title></title><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>We caught up with Trunk this week following&nbsp;the release of their latest album in <a href="https://metaldevastationradio.com/thebeast/blog/28053/">September</a>.</p><p><strong>RFB: In the press release for the album you write &#8220;This isn&#8217;t about perfection, it&#8217;s about power.&#8221; How did this mindset influence work in the studio for the record and also live performances?</strong></p><p>Trunk: Not overthinking the writing or process. Just put out what we feel is good and if people like it, even better. Doing things for yourself and not worrying about others opinions.</p><p><strong>RFB: What&#8217;s one thing you would want listeners to take away from this album?</strong></p><p>Trunk: It&#8217;s real. We&#8217;re not trying to write cool or groundbreaking. Just what we like.</p><p><strong>RFB: Who were/are your biggest influences?</strong></p><p>Trunk: Punk rock and old school death metal. Band wise: Entombed, Acid Bath, Cannibal Corpse, Morbid Angel</p><p><strong>RFB: What are some of your favorite bands right now? Who should we be checking out?</strong></p><p>Trunk: In Jest and Mutate Capacity from Philly rule. We got our southern homies Silico &amp; Deluseur.</p><div id="youtube2-anGLydu6Q_c" class="youtube-wrap" data-attrs="{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;anGLydu6Q_c&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}" data-component-name="Youtube2ToDOM"><div class="youtube-inner"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/anGLydu6Q_c?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0" frameborder="0" loading="lazy" gesture="media" allow="autoplay; fullscreen" allowautoplay="true" allowfullscreen="true" width="728" height="409"></iframe></div></div> ]]>
